{"4708480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Grass Cutting Simulator", "steam_appid": 4708480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a relaxing garden maintenance simulator where you use traditional tools to cut your lawn and trim your hedges. Ditch loud, gas-powered tools for the peace and quiet of sturdy, manual tools. Sweep away the stress of the day as you slice your way through tall, dense grass and discover the pure satisfaction of the scythe. Find the perfect, quiet rhythm as you let the momentum of the blade leave behind a perfectly clean cut. Trim back your troubles as you master the craft of sculpting overgrown bushes into many beautiful shapes with your trusty garden shears. Discover the beauty of manual labor with every crisp, satisfying snip.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a relaxing garden maintenance simulator where you use traditional tools to cut your lawn and trim your hedges. Ditch loud, gas-powered tools for the peace and quiet of sturdy, manual tools. Sweep away the stress of the day as you slice your way through tall, dense grass and discover the pure satisfaction of the scythe. Find the perfect, quiet rhythm as you let the momentum of the blade leave behind a perfectly clean cut. Trim back your troubles as you master the craft of sculpting overgrown bushes into many beautiful shapes with your trusty garden shears. Discover the beauty of manual labor with every crisp, satisfying snip.</p>", "short_description": "A relaxing garden care simulator where you use traditional tools to restore your garden to its former glory. Cut away the chaos of today as you slice through dense grass and sculpt beautiful shapes into hedges as you transform overgrown lawns across varied locations.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c